{"3451400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Don't Come Home Until You Save The World", "steam_appid": 3451400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young man named Craig who has to leave the quiet comfort of his quaint village to embark on a quest.  Craig might seem like your average JRPG male protagonist, but not all is what it seems. His hair isn't a cluster of spikes and he doesn't need his mom to wake him up in the mornings. He doesn't want to help the local girl find her missing cat or show the mystery woman around at the Inciting Incident Fair. He doesn't even want to save the world!<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Audible gasps.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And he's not even a teenager, he's...30! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scattered whispers</i><strong>. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that's right. He just wants to live an aggressively normal life despite ancient prophecies foretelling of Craig's arrival. Unfortunately for this world, he is the protagonist. Follow along his journey as he is thrust forward into a world at constant peril while he looks for ways to shirk his heroic duties and just return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alas, he can't come home until he saves the world.   </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young man named Craig who has to leave the quiet comfort of his quaint village to embark on a quest.  Craig might seem like your average JRPG male protagonist, but not all is what it seems. His hair isn't a cluster of spikes and he doesn't need his mom to wake him up in the mornings. He doesn't want to help the local girl find her missing cat or show the mystery woman around at the Inciting Incident Fair. He doesn't even want to save the world!<i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Audible gasps.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And he's not even a teenager, he's...30! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scattered whispers</i><strong>. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, that's right. He just wants to live an aggressively normal life despite ancient prophecies foretelling of Craig's arrival. Unfortunately for this world, he is the protagonist. Follow along his journey as he is thrust forward into a world at constant peril while he looks for ways to shirk his heroic duties and just return home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alas, he can't come home until he saves the world.   </p>", "short_description": "All you want to do is stay home in your quiet village town, but you can't. You have to embark on a journey to save the world...because you're the chosen one. Hm? Chosen by who? That's not important right now. What do you mean, &quot;Do you have to?&quot; YES, you have to. Stop asking questions, just go!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/f94e3453c24ada48a5c232f5ce8962dabfc02d43/header.jpg?t=1787938464", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/76f3f245bafac4c5cf91104981157310caf3df75/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787938464", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451400/76f3f245bafac4c5cf91104981157310caf3df75/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787938464", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Monterey</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Sequoia</li></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": [], "developers"